{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QNeHyeCddTwSU1xAHRwRZQ","type":"tool_result","content":"/bin/bash: line 1: cd: engine: No such file or directory\n250:| Kart racing (Super Mario Kart, F-Zero) | Mode 7 (the mode7 module, over any view) | `E.Mode7` over a TileMap track (floor tags: grass, sand, boost), `E.Car` karts (`kart: true`: hop, drift, boost) in an `E.Race` round an `E.Path` (laps, checkpoints, drivers, items), rigs in karts as billboards, `game.splitScreen(2)` for two | KART |\n272:  - `mode7`: the SNES's Mode 7 (`E.Mode7`): a camera at a height over a flat floor (a TileMap's, a color function's or a canvas), drawn a row at a time, a sky that turns with the heading (a Backdrop), billboards far to near (rigs at the size their distance gives, sprites, your drawing), fog, `project` and `toFloor`, a split screen's cameras. The stress test's depth view, KART.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e5d2d25a-213e-4769-95e4-216b30ab7269","uuid":"eb59e7c9-f3dc-4b98-951b-23d2ef867845","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:46:34.637Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"/bin/bash: line 1: cd: engine: No such file or directory\n250:| Kart racing (Super Mario Kart, F-Zero) | Mode 7 (the mode7 module, over any view) | `E.Mode7` over a TileMap track (floor tags: grass, sand, boost), `E.Car` karts (`kart: true`: hop, drift, boost) in an `E.Race` round an `E.Path` (laps, checkpoints, drivers, items), rigs in karts as billboards, `game.splitScreen(2)` for two | KART |\n272:  - `mode7`: the SNES's Mode 7 (`E.Mode7`): a camera at a height over a flat floor (a TileMap's, a color function's or a canvas), drawn a row at a time, a sky that turns with the heading (a Backdrop), billboards far to near (rigs at the size their distance gives, sprites, your drawing), fog, `project` and `toFloor`, a split screen's cameras. The stress test's depth view, KART.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_