d sticks and buttons in headless tests.\n\n## Prompt Feedback\n- What did you like most about this prompt? The 10-foot controller-first rules and the exact exit-interview shape. The plan gave exact numbers and an architecture to build on, and the attract mode, dev mode and touch-only rules were clear and testable.\n- What was confusing? The plan names a dev folder and html file for another model, date and effort while TASK.md names mine; I followed TASK.md. It was also unclear whether the plan's six operations were required or advisory, and what to write for usage when no figure is exposed.\n- What was the hardest thing to do? Covering every required system (attract, co-op, hub, dev sliders, glyphs, touch notice, About, exit interview) and balancing four operations and four bosses with no human playtester, and judging audio without hearing it.\n- What would you change in this prompt? Turn the required systems into a short acceptance checklist, say plainly which parts of a plan are binding, and provide a way to check sound headless.","ttft_ms":1674,"type":"result","duration_ms":2420002,"uuid":"95e51fea-b798-46aa-87fa-2f42f32f0cad","ttft_stream_ms":901,"time_to_request_ms":77,"first_content_frame_ms":901,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-sonnet-5-5":{"inputTokens":160,"outputTokens":226151,"cacheReadInputTokens":18449664,"cacheCreationInputTokens":351211,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":5.5116404,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":69726,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":351211,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":4,"outputTokens":1755,"cacheReadInputTokens":872,"cacheCreationInputTokens":287284,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.1839856,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1406,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":287284,"cacheCreationEphemeral1